  {
    "name": "FAQ",
    "settings": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_1_q",
        "label": "Question 1",
        "default": "How long does shipping take?",
        "info": "Six question/answer pairs shown on every product page (Sections → Show FAQ). Clear a question or its answer to hide that pair. Answers may link to the store's own pages with {{ShippingLink}}, {{RefundLink}}, {{ContactLink}}, {{TrackOrderLink}}, {{PrivacyLink}}, {{TermsLink}} and print the support email with {{CompanyEmail}} — each is filled in per store."
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_1_a",
        "label": "Answer 1",
        "default": "<p>Orders are processed within 1–3 business days. Delivery usually takes 7–15 business days depending on your location, and every order is tracked. See our <a href=\"{{ShippingLink}}\">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_2_q",
        "label": "Question 2",
        "default": "How can I track my order?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_2_a",
        "label": "Answer 2",
        "default": "<p>As soon as your package ships we email you the tracking number. You can also check the status any time on our <a href=\"{{TrackOrderLink}}\">Track your order</a> page.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_3_q",
        "label": "Question 3",
        "default": "Can I change or cancel my order?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_3_a",
        "label": "Answer 3",
        "default": "<p>Yes, within 12 hours of purchase. Email us at <a href=\"mailto:{{CompanyEmailPlain}}\">{{CompanyEmail}}</a> with your order number and we'll update or cancel it before it ships. After that the order is already on its way, but you can still return it under our <a href=\"{{RefundLink}}\">Refund Policy</a>.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_4_q",
        "label": "Question 4",
        "default": "What is your return and refund policy?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_4_a",
        "label": "Answer 4",
        "default": "<p>You have 45 days from delivery to return or exchange, even if you simply changed your mind. Full details are in our <a href=\"{{RefundLink}}\">Refund Policy</a>.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_5_q",
        "label": "Question 5",
        "default": "My item arrived damaged or isn't what I ordered. What now?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_5_a",
        "label": "Answer 5",
        "default": "<p>We're sorry! <a href=\"{{ContactLink}}\">Contact us</a> within 45 days with your order number and a photo, and we'll send a replacement or refund you in full.</p>"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "faq_6_q",
        "label": "Question 6",
        "default": "How can I reach customer support?"
      },
      {
        "type": "richtext",
        "id": "faq_6_a",
        "label": "Answer 6",
        "default": "<p>Email <a href=\"mailto:{{CompanyEmailPlain}}\">{{CompanyEmail}}</a> or use our <a href=\"{{ContactLink}}\">Contact page</a>. We reply within 24 hours on business days.</p>"
      }
    ]
  },
